# SHA-256 of every lane-persona.js that lane-control shipped before the current one. A project-level install brings
# an existing user-level copy up to date only when its bytes are one of these (adapter.py, SHIPPED_HASHES); a copy
# that differs, such as one with a local edit, is left as it is and named in the output.
